# Firebase Admin SDK service-account key for FCM HTTP v1 (server-side only).
#
# How to create:
# 1. Firebase Console → Project settings → Service accounts
# 2. Click "Generate new private key"
# 3. Save the downloaded JSON as:
#      backend/secrets/fcm-service-account.json   (gitignored)
#    OR paste base64/JSON into k8s secret FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON
#
# Local .env:
#   FCM_PROJECT_ID=fcatory23-apk
#   FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH=/absolute/path/to/fcm-service-account.json
#
# Never commit the real key file.
